// mcserver - dedicated co-op server for the voxel game.
//
// It is the authoritative copy of everything that used to live in the host's
// browser: players, block edit log, chat, PvP, world time, persistence.
// Terrain itself is still generated by each client from the shared seed; the
// server only stores the sparse list of edits on top of that terrain.
//
// It also serves the game page (index.html, embedded) so players just open
// http://<server>:8080 and press "Join Online Game".
package main

